{"seq":3,"slug":"metaclasses","title":"元类与类工厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/metaclasses","wordCount":801,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"元类与类工厂\">元类与类工厂</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>在 Python 中，类本身也是对象——它们是 <code>type</code> 的实例。元类（Metaclass）就是&quot;类的类&quot;，它控制类的创建过程。虽然大多数场景下不需要元类，但理解元类机制能帮助你深入理解 Python 对象模型，并在必要时实现高级框架功能。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>类创建在 Python 中不是一个原子操作，而是可介入的多阶段过程，元类的作用就是挂接到这些阶段上：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[class Foo metaclass=Meta] --&gt; B[__prepare__ 构造命名空间]&#10;  B --&gt; C[类体执行, 填充命名空间]&#10;  C --&gt; D[__new__ 创建类对象]&#10;  D --&gt; E[__init__ 初始化类对象]&#10;  E --&gt; F[类就绪]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Foo 实例化时走 __call__]&#10;  G --&gt; H[返回实例]\">graph TD\n  A[class Foo metaclass=Meta] --&gt; B[__prepare__ 构造命名空间]\n  B --&gt; C[类体执行, 填充命名空间]\n  C --&gt; D[__new__ 创建类对象]\n  D --&gt; E[__init__ 初始化类对象]\n  E --&gt; F[类就绪]\n  F --&gt; G[Foo 实例化时走 __call__]\n  G --&gt; H[返回实例]</pre><p>由此可以理清一张分工表：元类负责&quot;类的创建&quot;（<code>__new__</code> / <code>__init__</code> / <code>__prepare__</code>），<code>__call__</code> 负责&quot;类的实例化&quot;，而 <code>__init_subclass__</code> 只提供&quot;子类化钩子&quot;这一最常用的一环。绝大多数需求（注册、简单验证）用 <code>__init_subclass__</code> 或 <code>dataclasses</code> 就能满足，元类只在需要控制类创建全过程时才是必要的——这也是&quot;最后手段&quot;这一推荐度排序的由来。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"type-是一切类的元类\">type 是一切类的元类</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class Foo:&#10;    pass&#10;&#10;print(type(Foo))        # &lt;class &#39;type&#39;&gt;&#10;print(type(int))        # &lt;class &#39;type&#39;&gt;&#10;print(type(type))       # &lt;class &#39;type&#39;&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Foo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Foo))        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># &#x3C;class 'type'></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># &#x3C;class 'type'></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># &#x3C;class 'type'></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph BT&#10;  Foo --&gt; type&#10;  int --&gt; type&#10;  str --&gt; type&#10;  type --&gt; type\">graph BT\n  Foo --&gt; type\n  int --&gt; type\n  str --&gt; type\n  type --&gt; type</pre><p><code>type</code> 既是所有类的元类，也是自身的实例——这是 Python 对象模型的&quot;原点&quot;。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"用-type-动态创建类\">用 type 动态创建类</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def greet(self):&#10;    return f&quot;Hello, {self.name}&quot;&#10;&#10;User = type(&quot;User&quot;, (object,), {&quot;name&quot;: &quot;default&quot;, &quot;greet&quot;: greet})&#10;&#10;u = User()&#10;u.name = &quot;Alice&quot;&#10;print(u.greet())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">User </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"User\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,), {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"greet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: greet})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">u.name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Alice\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(u.greet())</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>type(name, bases, namespace)</code> 三个参数分别对应类名、基类元组和类属性字典。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义元类\">自定义元类</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ValidatedMeta(type):&#10;    def __new__(mcs, name, bases, namespace):&#10;        cls = super().__new__(mcs, name, bases, namespace)&#10;        for key, value in namespace.items():&#10;            if isinstance(value, type) and issubclass(value, Exception):&#10;                raise TypeError(f&quot;Class {name} cannot have Exception subclass as attribute&quot;)&#10;        return cls&#10;&#10;class MyModel(metaclass=ValidatedMeta):&#10;    name: str = &quot;default&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ValidatedMeta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __new__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mcs, name, bases, namespace):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        cls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__new__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mcs, name, bases, namespace)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key, value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> namespace.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isinstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> issubclass</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Exception</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                raise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TypeError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Class </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cannot have Exception subclass as attribute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MyModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">metaclass</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ValidatedMeta</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"default\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"元类方法调用顺序\">元类方法调用顺序</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>调用时机</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>__prepare__(mcs, name, bases)</code></td>\n<td>创建命名空间前</td>\n<td>返回自定义字典（如 OrderedDict）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__new__(mcs, name, bases, ns)</code></td>\n<td>创建类对象</td>\n<td>修改类属性、添加验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__init__(cls, name, bases, ns)</code></td>\n<td>初始化类对象</td>\n<td>后处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>__call__(cls, *args)</code></td>\n<td>类被实例化时</td>\n<td>控制实例创建过程</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"__init_subclass__-轻量替代元类\"><code>__init_subclass__</code>：轻量替代元类</h2><p>Python 3.6 引入的 <code>__init_subclass__</code> 是元类的轻量替代方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class Plugin:&#10;    registry: dict[str, type] = {}&#10;&#10;    def __init_subclass__(cls, plugin_name: str = &quot;&quot;, **kwargs):&#10;        super().__init_subclass__(**kwargs)&#10;        name = plugin_name or cls.__name__.lower()&#10;        Plugin.registry[name] = cls&#10;&#10;class JSONPlugin(Plugin, plugin_name=&quot;json&quot;):&#10;    pass&#10;&#10;class XMLPlugin(Plugin, plugin_name=&quot;xml&quot;):&#10;    pass&#10;&#10;print(Plugin.registry)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    registry: dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init_subclass__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cls, plugin_name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init_subclass__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">kwargs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plugin_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lower()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        Plugin.registry[name] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cls</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JSONPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">plugin_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> XMLPlugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Plugin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">plugin_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"xml\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Plugin.registry)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"元类-vs-__init_subclass__\">元类 vs <code>__init_subclass__</code></h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>元类</th>\n<th><code>__init_subclass__</code></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复杂度</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制类创建全过程</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌（仅子类化钩子）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可与其他元类共存</td>\n<td>需处理冲突</td>\n<td>自然共存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>ORM、序列化框架</td>\n<td>注册、简单验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推荐度</td>\n<td>最后手段</td>\n<td>优先选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dataclasses-声明式类工厂\">dataclasses：声明式类工厂</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from dataclasses import dataclass, field&#10;&#10;@dataclass(frozen=True, slots=True)&#10;class Point:&#10;    x: float&#10;    y: float&#10;    label: str = field(default=&quot;origin&quot;, repr=False)&#10;&#10;    @property&#10;    def distance(self) -&gt; float:&#10;        return (self.x ** 2 + self.y ** 2) ** 0.5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#